The public Proton VPN API-Core tag does not include the complete source needed
to rebuild its compiled Protun dependency. This source package therefore
contains Proton's exact repository-distributed 5.6.10 amd64 binary package as
a pinned upstream component.

`rebuild_overlay.py` verifies that package and its control scripts, extracts
the payload, translates only the distribution-specific Python path in the five
shared patches, and rejects any installed change outside the six manifest
entries. The compiled networking payload is copied byte-for-byte.
